@czort5223 I hear your concerns and I appreciate you sharing them. However, I’d like to gently reassure you that no content was stolen for this video. I put a lot of personal time and heart into creating every piece of content here.

I view AI simply as a supporting tool to help enhance the production. The core ideas, the selection process, and the final result are all led by my own efforts as a human creator. These are authentic videos that I’ve worked hard on.

I’m still learning and will continue to work hard to improve my process and make my videos even better for everyone. Thank you for the feedback, it helps me grow.
